  "baseDecision": "Before geometry, courtFloor2.9123m fixed from independent[45,0] source height+.15m; westernFloor1.3971m from independent pit5/6-centre samples+.15m. Individual store and searchlight levels sampled at mapped centres+.15m. Water-1.2397m from independent western-water point[-70,20]+.08m; not a surveyed tide datum. Relative court/roof/bank/pit levels are recorded medium-fi section estimates from primary architectural form. Source DEM contains earthworks/shoreline effects and does not resolve every excavation, floor or bank, so channel and hidden-section contact remains approximate. Whole court/grass banks/retaining faces are authored construction geometry over the fixed field; original16641 values/grid/PNG/four raw tiles unchanged. No flattening, fitting or reacquisition. Replacement disabled. Gun-cotton/priming pit/1903searchlight/old jetty/winch traces and T-position are explicitly unmapped relative-location estimates; no modern pontoon substituted.",
  "firingSectorDecision": "Authored grass-bank section immediately northwest of pit4 remains below its firing opening/barrel, as the inspected original and primary170degree open-front description require. The local5.0623m maximum is a bounded structural profile within the already fixed court/pit/bank sections; this changes authored earthwork geometry, never the independent DEM/grid/heightfield/raw tiles. Exact local rampart grading unsurveyed.",
  "gun4RoofDecision": "Pit4 overhead protection follows the actual mapped rear support line with a semicircular/half-elliptical front, as primary description and inspected original require. Rear overhang0.25m and front projection5.25m are bounded section estimates within the mapped8m-scale emplacement; no survey of the precise slab curve is asserted."
